\n  M00 - programmed stop
\n  M01 - conditional stop
\n  M02 - END program
\n  M03 - spindle right cw on
\n  M04 - spindle left ccw on
\n  M05 - spindle off
\n  M07 - coolant inside on
\n  M08 - coolant on
\n  M09 - coolant off
\n  M10 - clamping axes
\n  M11 - unclamping axes
\n  M13 - spindle right coolant on
\n  M14 - spindle left coolant on
\n  M17 - coolant additional
\n  M19 - spindle orientation 0 degree
\n  M20 - spindle orientation CYCL 13
\n  M21 - start index table
\n  M30 - END program
\n  M31 - working without M3/M4
\n  M32 - working area monitoring off
